<title>USA: Stryker sets year-end cash payout.</title>
<headline>Stryker sets year-end cash payout.</headline>
<dateline>KALAMAZOO, Mich. 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stryker Corp on Friday said its board declared a higher annual dividend of $0.10 a share, payable January 31 to shareholders of record as of December 31.</p>
<p>David Simpson, chief financial officer, said Stryker has paid an annual dividend for several years. Last year's annual payout was $0.045 a share.</p>
<p>The amount of annual dividends is determined each year by the board, he added.</p>
<p>Stryker makes and markets specialty surgical and medical products.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
